[Trigger]
Name	lowTide
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Greywater lies on an underground river, master, and its warden trades with dwarves and sells iron to anyone with coin. You have no coin, so dig for it first.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Corwin Gray in the river hall in the north.
Action	objective	1	Mine 600 gold from the cave walls.
Action	objective	1	Keep your dungeon heart alive.
Action	portal	0	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstCoin
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	600
Action	message	1	That is a start. Two goblins heard the clink and want to join you. A bridge crossing is open south of the dungeon.
Action	spawn	1	15	74	1	Goblin:1	Goblin:1	Spider:1
Action	reveal	1	SouthLanding
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	quarryClaimed
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Quarry	120
Action	message	1	The quarry is yours. Prisoners can be put to better use than idling in cells.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	southBankReached
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthLanding
Action	message	1	Across the water another keeper holds a dungeon of his own, and the Greywater heroes are laying siege to it. If he falls, they will turn on you.
Action	reveal	1	Siege
Action	reveal	1	RivalHeart
Action	objective	1	Cross the river and look at the besieged dungeon.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	siegeSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Siege
Action	message	1	The besiegers are thin. Strike them from behind and the rival will have to deal with you, not them.
Action	spawn	3	36	30	2	Knight:2	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	midBankHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	MidBank	60
Action	message	1	The middle bank is held. Heavier creatures are ready to serve, and the sluice gate on the east bank grinds open.
Action	spawn	1	16	75	1	Orc:2	Goblin:2
Action	reveal	1	NorthBank
Action	terrain	38	17	42	17	path
Action	setflag	sluiceOpen	1
Action	portal	0	on
Action	generate	1	Spider:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wharfSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Wharf
Action	message	1	The river hall is just ahead. Gray has called his dwarf guards from the cellars.
Action	spawn	3	44	14	1	Dwarf2:2	Dwarf2:2	Knight:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	siegeOne
Mode	once
Cond	time	420
Action	message	1	More heroes are crossing the south bridge to join the siege.
Action	spawn	3	35	64	2	Adventurer:2	Knight:2	Dwarf1:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	siegeTwo
Mode	once
Cond	time	1000
Action	message	1	The besiegers have started a second assault, and part of it is turning on you.
Action	spawn	3	28	48	1	Knight:2	Dwarf2:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	siegeThree
Mode	once
Cond	time	1700
Action	message	1	The river hall is sending every dwarf it has. They are marching down the east bank.
Action	spawn	3	38	24	1	Knight:3	Dwarf2:3	Dwarf1:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	siegeFour
Mode	once
Cond	time	2400
Action	message	1	Gray is out of patience. Hold your heart.
Action	spawn	3	28	70	1	Knight:3	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Adventurer:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sluiceTimeout
Mode	once
Cond	time	2000
Cond	flag	sluiceOpen	0
Action	message	1	The river hall has lifted its sluice gate on the east bank. The way north is open.
Action	terrain	38	17	42	17	path
Action	setflag	sluiceOpen	1
Action	portal	0	on
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenFalls
Mode	once
Cond	event	CorwinGray	killed
Action	message	1	Corwin Gray is dead and the river belongs to you. The dwarves will want new terms.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sluiceKey
Mode	once
Cond	time	4
Action	stoneattach	SluiceWarden
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sluiceKeyFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	alive	SluiceWarden	0
Cond	flag	sluiceOpen	0
Action	message	1	The sluice warden is down and the key he wore lies in the dust. It turns in the old lock and the sluice gate on the east bank grinds open.
Action	terrain	38	17	42	17	path
Action	setflag	sluiceOpen	1
Action	portal	0	on
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
